# Downloaded CI artifacts and unpacked installers. These are build output, not
# source: the installer alone is ~1.5 MB and changes on every build, so tracking
# it made every build show up as a large diff and pushed stale copies of the app
# into the repo where they could be mistaken for the current one.
dist/
